  :decided "JCS40 (a): deferred to JC5, a file's classes one defclasses (JCS30 (b)), the bridge and the array descriptor checked there (doc/classes/JAVA-CONFORMANCE-SURVEY.md, \"Decided (2026-10-25): JCS40-JCS49\")"
